        | Vehicle.Powertrain.Transmission.CurrentGear | int8 | 0 |
        


    Scenario Outline: Unsubscribe of one subscription_id does not hinder other subscription_ids
        Given a signal at <path> is set to <value_0> of datatype <datatype>
        And attempts to subscribe the signal at <path> of datatype <datatype> for <count> times with duplex <duplex> are all succeeded
        When attempts to unsubscribe the signal at <path> of datatype <datatype> is succeeded
        And the value of signal at <path> changes to <value_1> of datatype <datatype>
        Then The other subscription_ids stream returns <datatype> <value_1> on <path>

    Examples:
        | path                                                     | count         | duplex        | datatype      | value_0       | value_1       |
        | Vehicle.Powertrain.AccumulatedBrakingEnergy | 2 | 1 | float | 0.0 | 3.4028235e+38 |
        | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.DieselExhaustFluid.IsLevelLow | 2 | 1 | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.DieselExhaustFluid.Level | 2 | 1 | uint8 | 50 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.DieselExhaustFluid.Range | 2 | 1 | uint32 | 2147483647 | 4294967295 |
        | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.EOP | 2 | 1 | uint16 | 32767 | 65535 |
        | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.EngineCoolant.Level | 2 | 1 | string | LOW | CRITICALLY_LOW |
        | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.EngineCoolant.LifeRemaining | 2 | 1 | int32 | 0 | 2147483647 |
        | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.Torque | 2 | 1 | int16 | 0 | 32767 |
        | Vehicle.Powertrain.TractionBattery.Charging.ChargeCurrent.ThreePhaseCurrentMeasurements | 2 | 1 | complex | {"Phase1":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Phase2":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Phase3":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} | {"Phase1":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38},"Phase2":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38},"Phase3":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38}} |
        | Vehicle.Powertrain.TractionBattery.Charging.ChargeVoltage.ThreePhaseVoltageMeasurements | 2 | 1 | complex | {"Phase1":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Phase2":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Phase3":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} | {"Phase1":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38},"Phase2":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38},"Phase3":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38}} |
