        | Vehicle.Powertrain.TractionBattery.Number1.CurrentElectricity | 2 | 1 | complex | {"Voltage":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Current":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} | {"Voltage":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38},"Current":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38}} |
